<title>USA: OshKosh B'Gosh sets shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>OshKosh B'Gosh sets shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>OshKosh B'Gosh Inc said Monday it plans to buy back up to two million common shares in a &quot;Dutch auction.&quot;</p>
<p>The self-tender offer consists of shares of its Class A and/or Class B common stock. The tender offer price will range from $19.00 to $22.00 per share in cash, subject to market and other customary conditions, the company said.</p>
<p>The tender offer is expected to begin later today and is set to at midnight EDT on July 29.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
